[32.293782, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;16mup (for exa\u001b[15Gpl\u001b[18G, 7%\u001b[23Gtax on 1050 cents\u001b[41Gmust be 74\u001b[52Gcents, not 73). \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btests/test_money.py pins the required behaviour; you can run it \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mwith \u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest tests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m. Fix it and tell me when\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;16mit is done. Do not commit; do not push.\u001b[39m                             \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'll fix\u001b[12Gthe\u001b[16Grounding\u001b[25Gissue\u001b[31Gin\u001b[34G\u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m.\u001b[47GLet\u001b[51Gme\u001b[54Gstart\u001b[60Gby\u001b[63Greading\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[7Gcode\u001b[12Gand\u001b[16Gtests.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI can\u001b[9Gsee the is\u001b[20Gue. The curren\u001b[35G \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m uses floor division\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B(\u001b[38;5;105m//\u001b[39m), which drops fractions instead \u001b[40Gf rounding half up. I need to\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bchange it to use the\u001b[24Ground-half-up\u001b[38Gformula:\u001b[47G\u001b[38;5;105m(total_cents + divisor \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B// 2) // divisor\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BLet me also\u001b[15Gcheck\u001b[21Gwhat\u001b[26G\u001b[38;5;105mtax_cents()\u001b[38G\u001b[39mdoes\u001b[43Gto\u001b[46Gunderstand\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gfull\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcontext:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow\u001b[7GI'll\u001b[12Gfix\u001b[16G\u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[28G\u001b[39mto\u001b[31Gimplement\u001b[41Ground-half-up:\r\u00